                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wacu kumae: Mi gondri adek mi Dameski, eyo, mir ang’wen, abiloko masendine cen ungo; kum gifodo Gilead ku jamfodo mi nyunyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento abioro mac i ot pa Hazael, man ebiwang’u udi mi ker pa Ben-hadad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man abituro utwindi mi Dameski, man abikabu ng’atu m’ubedo i poga mir Aven woko, ku ng’atu m’umaku uluth mi ker kud i ot mir Aden; e dhanu mi Cami bicidho i ng’eca cil kum Kir, Yehova wacu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
